using StateSystem

~ station_arrive
Narrator: The station is empty.\nThe clock reads 11:47 PM.\nA train hums below.
- 进站检票 [if StateSystem.hope_despair >= 2 and StateSystem.hope_despair >= 0]
	=> kw_arrive
- 转身走回出口 [if StateSystem.hope_despair <= -4]
	=> tb_arrive
- 在长椅上坐下
	=> st_arrive

~ kw_arrive
Narrator: The train hums in the distance.\nThe platform is quiet.\nYou hear your heartbeat.
- Step to the edge.
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"will": 0.5})
	=> kw_edge

~ kw_edge
Narrator: The yellow line glows.\nLight at the tunnel end.\nThe wet night behind.
- Look back at the city.
	=> kw_lookback
- Face forward.
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"conviction": 0.5})
	=> kw_stranger

~ kw_lookback
Narrator: The city glitters beyond.\nThe office, the bridge, the store.\nAll behind you now.
- Turn forward.
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"will": 0.5})
	=> kw_stranger

~ kw_stranger
Stranger: 下次再见。
- 「下次再见。……或者说，下次再见自己。」 [if StateSystem.has_flag("stranger_revealed")]
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 2})
	=> kw_stranger_meta
- 「再见。」
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 2})
	=> kw_train

~ kw_train
Narrator: The doors slide open.\nWarm light spills out.\nYou step inside.
- Sit by the window.
	=> kw_final

~ kw_final
Narrator: The train pulls away.\nRain streaks past the glass.\nFor the first time, you breathe.
- — Keep Walking —
	do StateSystem.set_flag("ending_keep_walking", true)
	do StateSystem.set_route_flag("keep_walking")
	=> END

~ tb_arrive
Narrator: The station entrance gapes.\nYou stop at the stairs.\nSomething holds you back.
- Walk down anyway.
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"will": 0.5})
	=> tb_gate
- Turn around now.
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"conviction": -0.5})
	=> tb_street

~ tb_gate
Narrator: The ticket gate hums.\nA single light flickers.\nYou reach out, stop.
- Reach for the gate.
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"will": 0.5})
	=> tb_decision
- Pull your hand back.
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"conviction": -0.5})
	=> tb_decision

~ tb_decision
Narrator: You can't.\nYou turn.\nThe exit sign glows red.
- Walk back.
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"conviction": -0.5, "hope_despair": -1})
	=> tb_street

~ tb_street
Stranger: 你确定？
- 「你知道我在想什么？」 [if StateSystem.has_flag("stranger_revealed")]
	=> tb_stranger_meta
- 「我确定。」
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"conviction": -0.5})
	=> tb_final
- 「……不。」
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": -1})
	=> tb_final

~ tb_final
Narrator: You step into the rain.\nThe street is empty.\nThe night never ends.
- — Turn Back —
	do StateSystem.set_flag("ending_turn_back", true)
	do StateSystem.set_route_flag("turn_back")
	=> END

~ st_arrive
Narrator: The station is empty.\n11:47 PM is frozen.\nYou stop walking.
- Look around.
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"will": 0.5})
	=> st_bench
- Approach the bench.
	=> st_bench

~ st_bench
Narrator: The bench is cold.\nYou sit.\nThe air is still.
- Close your eyes.
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 1})
	=> st_train_passes
- Watch the tunnel.
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"conviction": 0.5})
	=> st_train_passes

~ st_train_passes
Narrator: The last train arrives.\nDoors slide open.\nNo one gets on or off.
- Stand up.
	=> st_stranger
- Stay seated.
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"will": 0.5})
	=> st_stranger

~ st_stranger
Stranger: ………
- （点头） [if StateSystem.has_flag("stranger_revealed")]
	=> st_stranger_meta
- Watch them go.
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"conviction": 0.5, "hope_despair": 1})
	=> st_final

~ st_final
Narrator: The clock ticks: 11:48.\nThe platform hums.\nYou're still here. That's okay.
- — Stay —
	do StateSystem.set_flag("ending_stay", true)
	do StateSystem.set_route_flag("stay")
	=> END

~ kw_stranger_meta
Stranger: 下次再见。\n……或者说，\n下次再见自己。
- 「再见。」
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 2})
	=> kw_train

~ tb_stranger_meta
Stranger: 你确定？\n我知道你在想什么。\n⌈因为我就是你。⌋
- 「……我确定。」
	do StateSystem.set_flag("stranger_meta_ending", true)
	=> tb_final

~ st_stranger_meta
Stranger: ………\n⌈你懂了吗？⌋
- （看着他们离开）
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"conviction": 1.0, "hope_despair": 2})
	=> st_final
